      "patternId": "n7-diplomatic-disagreement-1"
    },
    {
      "id": "en.n7.class-31.t04",
      "en": "I see what you mean, but I'm not sure that's fair on Sara.",
      "es": "Veo lo que dices, pero no estoy seguro de que sea justo para Sara.",
      "explanationEs": "I see what you mean + but + duda suave: el suavizador va delante.",
      "segments": [
        "I see what you mean, but I'm",
        "not sure that's fair on Sara."
