      "audioText": "I see what you mean, but I'm not sure that's fair on Sara.",
      "audioMode": "tts",
      "languageCode": "en",
      "patternId": "n7-diplomatic-disagreement-1"
    },
    {
      "id": "en.n7.class-31.t05",
      "en": "Saying “You're wrong” sounds blunt, and the tone matters between flatmates.",
      "es": "Decir «te equivocas» suena brusco, y el tono importa entre compañeros de piso.",
      "explanationEs": "Blunt = sin rodeos, sin suavizar. Entre amigos el tono pesa tanto como las palabras.",
      "segments": [
        "Saying “You're wrong” sounds blunt, and",
        "the tone matters between flatmates."
